                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "139786d8-2218-450f-a17e-fe396af3f84c",
                                                "sense_id": "46e79936-cf4a-3277-bf2f-ef2d3ce2a4d2",
                                                "text": "blow out the candles on the birthday cake"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3168d42-825b-4ec6-9eba-de1630f087b5",
                                                "sense_id": "46e79936-cf4a-3277-bf2f-ef2d3ce2a4d2",
                                                "text": "snuff out the candle"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d6ecae9-7293-35ac-844c-9a3215b25e6e",
                                        "entry_id": "76cc9714-7809-3291-902f-74e42790c140",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The protruding, removable portion of a filter, particularly a water filter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "061e0b62-1879-392a-a8c6-63549f9c1314",
                                        "entry_id": "76cc9714-7809-3291-902f-74e42790c140",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A unit of luminous intensity, now replaced by the SI unit candela."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f4dc24b-ed27-3ca5-951c-30440e51a165",
                                        "entry_id": "76cc9714-7809-3291-902f-74e42790c140",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fast-growing, light-colored, upward-growing shoot on a pine tree in the spring. As growth slows in summer, the shoot darkens and is no longer conspicuous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26c89c49-d066-365e-b3df-47306014f563",
                                        "entry_id": "76cc9714-7809-3291-902f-74e42790c140",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Indicates how high or low church something is by height on the candle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f7942a6-8f7c-4a7d-94dc-0dad5b06d311",
                                                "sense_id": "26c89c49-d066-365e-b3df-47306014f563",
                                                "text": "That vicar used to be an evangelical, but she's crept up the candle in recent years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7435d56e-e17f-428d-93aa-230414a72071",
                                                "sense_id": "26c89c49-d066-365e-b3df-47306014f563",
                                                "text": "That’s why self-consciously Anglo-catholic churches which are a mile high up the paschal candle can do reasonably well in the current climate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23483008-0164-4bd5-a67d-3a321ca263b9",
                                                "sense_id": "26c89c49-d066-365e-b3df-47306014f563",
                                                "text": "For those towards the top of the candle, receiving holy communion is not the same as a celebration of the mass, and mailing the sacred host demonstrates a serious lack of reverence for the sacrament."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef253635-2cf3-4b6e-83f3-75478134663c",
                                                "sense_id": "26c89c49-d066-365e-b3df-47306014f563",
                                                "text": "Clergy higher up the candle had different ideas. From the 1920s, Anglo-Papalism had favoured Roman fashions, and many of the Catholic clergy wore Latin cassocks — with plain or lacy cottas, and birettas — for the Offices; and, eschewing the surplice, an amice and alb — usually with Latin vestments — for the eucharist."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
